usage: pretrain_classifier.py [-h] --manifest MANIFEST --output OUTPUT
                              [--fold FOLD] [--epochs EPOCHS] [--steps STEPS]
                              [--patch-size PATCH_SIZE]
                              [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE] [--workers WORKERS]
                              [--seed SEED] [--split-seed SPLIT_SEED]
                              [--lr LR] [--warmup-epochs WARMUP_EPOCHS]
                              [--stats-samples STATS_SAMPLES]
                              [--validation-patches VALIDATION_PATCHES]
                              [--eval-every EVAL_EVERY]
                              [--sampling {standard,geometry}]
                              [--sampling-fov {full,image-body}]
                              [--guidance-weight GUIDANCE_WEIGHT]
                              [--init-checkpoint INIT_CHECKPOINT]
                              [--init-domain {airway,asoca}]
                              [--semantic-head-policy {reinit,load}]
                              [--device {cpu,cuda}] [--resume] [--smoke]
                              [--diagnostic-original-dev] [--plan]

Train the unchanged three-head classifier on 28 patients; select on internal
four. The original eight development cases are never used for early checkpoint
choice. Loss alone is not evidence that a classifier is useful: per-head
confusion, balanced accuracy, absent classes and training-majority baselines
are reported.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --manifest MANIFEST
  --output OUTPUT
  --fold FOLD
  --epochs EPOCHS
  --steps STEPS
  --patch-size PATCH_SIZE
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
  --workers WORKERS
  --seed SEED
  --split-seed SPLIT_SEED
  --lr LR
  --warmup-epochs WARMUP_EPOCHS
  --stats-samples STATS_SAMPLES
  --validation-patches VALIDATION_PATCHES
  --eval-every EVAL_EVERY
  --sampling {standard,geometry}
  --sampling-fov {full,image-body}
  --guidance-weight GUIDANCE_WEIGHT
  --init-checkpoint INIT_CHECKPOINT
  --init-domain {airway,asoca}
  --semantic-head-policy {reinit,load}
  --device {cpu,cuda}
  --resume
  --smoke
  --diagnostic-original-dev
  --plan
